pothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma\">\\(X,\\Sigma\\)</span> (measurable-space carrier and sigma algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (equivalence class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"58-df-equivalence\">58-df-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (integrable measurable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability\">../batch01/58-df-integrability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (measure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int(\\cdot)\\,d\\mu\">\\(\\int(\\cdot)\\,d\\mu\\)</span> (integral with respect to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10L1EquivalenceClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10L1EquivalenceClass}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}l1\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10L1EquivalenceClass}_S(C,f,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land C=\\{g\\in V:\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(g,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}l1\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10L1EquivalenceClass}_S(C,f,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land C=\\{g\\in V:\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(g,1,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier is restricted by the actual five-argument integrability predicate; equality is equality almost everywhere.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-integrability]]","embed":false},{"target":"5